              "key": "工期",
              "variant": "default",
              "html": "分两段走，不跳步：<span class=\"flow-step\"><b>先齐前置</b>（业务同意 + 负责人具名 + 费用确认）</span><span class=\"flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"flow-step\"><b>约 4 周内部演示</b></span><span class=\"flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"flow-step\"><b>约 4 周内部小试用</b></span> · 前置不齐不开开发 · 演示/试用不过则停扩重测（详见「怎么走」）"
